,"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b1-032","lemma":"Befund","display_de":"der Befund","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"B2","level_tags":["B2"],"topic_tags":["medical","病院・薬局"],"scene_tags":["medical"],"japanese":"検査所見、結果","example_de":"Der Befund wird direkt an Ihre Hausärztin geschickt.","example_ja":"検査所見はかかりつけ医へ直接送られます。","grammar":{"article":"der","plural":"Befunde"},"collocations":["einen Befund besprechen","ein unauffälliger Befund"],"learning_note":"単なる数値結果 Ergebnis より、医療者がまとめた所見を指します。","related_terms":["das Ergebnis","die Diagnose"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b1-034","lemma":"Betriebskostenabrechnung","display_de":"die Betriebskostenabrechnung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"B2","level_tags":["B2"],"topic_tags":["housing","住まい"],"scene_tags":["housing"],"japanese":"年間の共益費精算書","example_de":"Bitte erläutern Sie mir diese Position in der Betriebskostenabrechnung.","example_ja":"共益費精算書のこの項目を説明してください。","grammar":{"article":"die","plural":"Betriebskostenabrechnungen"},"collocations":["die Abrechnung prüfen","eine Nachzahlung aus der Abrechnung"],"learning_note":"毎月の前払い Nebenkosten と、年次精算 Abrechnung を区別します。","related_terms":["die Nebenkosten","die Nachzahlung"],"source_note":"J-Connect original example and explanation","source_refs":["j-connect-editorial"],"quality_tier":"editorial-reviewed","verification_status":"j-connect-editorial-reviewed","updated_at":"2026-08-14","verified_at":"2026-08-14"},{"card_id":"b1-035","lemma":"Mieterhöhung","display_de":"die Mieterhöhung","unit_type":"word","part_of_speech":"noun","primary_level":"B2","level_tags":["B2"],"topic_tags":["hous